## Wiring an external LED
To use an external LED instead of the built-in one, connect it like this:

```
MCU pin ──[220Ω–330Ω resistor]──►|── GND
                                LED (long leg = anode toward resistor)
```

The resistor is required, because it limits the current through the LED.

