**Design choices you may want to change:**
- **`id`** is a UUID string. If you use auto-increment IDs, switch to `"type": "integer", "minimum": 1`.
- **`signupDate`** is a full timestamp. Use `"format": "date"` if you only need the day (`2026-10-20`).
- **`roles`** accepts any non-empty strings. To restrict it to a fixed set, replace `items` with `{ "enum": ["admin", "editor", "viewer"] }`.
- **`additionalProperties: false`** rejects unknown fields. Remove it if you want the schema to be more lenient.

